@startuml keycloak-token-validation-flow
!theme plain
scale 0.2

title JWT Token Validation Flow\n(Spring Boot Resource Server)

start

:Backend receives API request;
note right
    Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6...
end note

:1. Extract JWT Token\nfrom Authorization header;

:2. Decode JWT Header\nExtract 'kid' (Key ID);

:3. Fetch JWKS from Keycloak\n(or use cached keys);
note right
    GET /realms/my-realm/protocol/openid-connect/certs

    Response contains RSA public keys
    with corresponding 'kid' identifiers
end note

:4. Find Public Key\nmatching 'kid';

:5. Verify Signature\nRS256 / RSA algorithm;

if (Signature Valid?) then (yes)
    :6. Validate JWT Claims;
    note right
        • iss (issuer) - must match expected issuer
        • exp (expiry) - token not expired
        • aud (audience) - contains expected audience
        • nbf (not before) - token is already valid
        • iat (issued at) - reasonable timestamp
    end note

    if (All Claims Valid?) then (yes)
        :7. Extract Roles & Scopes\nfrom JWT payload;
        note right
            Extract from:
            resource_access.backend-api.roles

            Example:
            • api-user
            • data-read
        end note

        :8. Authorize Request\nCheck @PreAuthorize\nannotations;

        if (Has Required Permission?) then (yes)
            #C1E1C1:200 OK\nProcess Request\nReturn Data;
            stop
        else (no)
            #FFB3BA:403 Forbidden\nInsufficient Permissions;
            note right
                User authenticated but lacks
                required role/permission
            end note
            stop
        endif
    else (no)
        #FFB3BA:401 Unauthorized\nClaims Invalid;
        note right
            Possible issues:
            • Token expired
            • Wrong issuer
            • Invalid audience
            • Token used before nbf
        end note
        stop
    endif
else (no)
    #FFB3BA:401 Unauthorized\nInvalid Token Signature;
    note right
        Token has been tampered with
        or signed by wrong key
    end note
    stop
endif

legend right
    |= Status |= Meaning |
    | 200 OK | Success - authorized |
    | 401 Unauthorized | Invalid/expired token |
    | 403 Forbidden | Valid token, insufficient permissions |
endlegend

footer Keycloak 26.5.7 | JWT Validation Flow | Generated: April 7, 2026

@enduml

